  "highlight": "Tobey-Anne Saracino crossed the English Channel from England to France in 13 hours 33 minutes on 28 August 2008.",
  "biography": [
    "Saracino made the English Channel her first of three featured marathon swims. She came ashore in France at 22:23 on 28 August 2008. A Manhattan circuit followed in 2010, then a Catalina-to-mainland crossing in 2011.",
